{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30157","headline":"早发灵芝望九华寄杜员外使君 · 曹汾","name":"早发灵芝望九华寄杜员外使君","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"戴月早辞三秀馆，迟明初识久华峰。\n嵯嵯玉劒寒鋩利，褭褭青莲翠叶重。\n奇状却疑人画出，岚光如爲客添浓。\n行春若到五溪上，此处褰帷正面逢。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"曹汾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30157.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30157","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}